<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="mb-5">Our Background</h1>
</div>
<p class="mt-5">
    JCL was founded in 2026 by a group of three students who wanted to improve on the audio industry by creating the products that consumers have been asking for.
    Named after its three founders, Jacob Stover, Caleb Day, and Luke Hinson, the company was first conceptualized when the three got together for a group project analyzing the work of other audio companies.
    Having their own ideas for how to improve the industry, they decided to start their own company to bring their ideas to life.
</p>